    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41512" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιφθον-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>grudge</i> any one's doing a thing, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾧ δέ κ᾽ ἐπιφθονέοις</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἆσσον ἴμεν</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				11.149
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>bear hate</i> or <i>a grudge against,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.79
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMasp.</u>
				154.9
			</span></i><span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be regarded with jealous hate,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				9.43
			</span></i>.</div>
